{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And He heard our voice.</b> Through the blessing with which our father blessed us — ״הַקֹּל קוֹל יַעֲקֹב״ — that we cry out and are answered (Tanchuma Beshalach)." "<b>An angel.</b> This is Moses — from here that the prophets are called angels. And so it says: ״וַיֹּהִיוּ מַלְעִיבִים בְּמַלְאֲכֵי הָאֱלֹהִים״ (II Chronicles 36)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:44.830143753Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}